   {
    "url": "https://lighthouseelectric.co/services/",
    "title": "Services - Lighthouse Electric",
    "text": "Services - Lighthouse Electric Home Services Team Contact Us Select Page Comprehensive Electrical Solutions for Every Need At Lighthouse Electric, we are committed to providing reliable and customized electrical services tailored to your home’s unique needs. With a focus on quality, safety, and customer satisfaction, we offer a range of services designed to enhance your living environment with the expertise and support you can trust. Let's get connected! Call Us: ( 502)849-3920 Residential Remodels Whether you are upgrading your home’s electrical system or undertaking a full remodel, our team is here to ensure your project is completed safely and efficiently. We specialize in modernizing electrical systems to meet current standards and enhance your home’s functionality, offering innovative solutions that blend seamlessly with your design vision. Electrical Services From routine maintenance to emergency repairs, our electrical service team is ready to handle any issue with professionalism and precision. We offer comprehensive diagnostics, troubleshooting, and repair services to keep your home safe and your electrical systems running smoothly. Rely on us for prompt, reliable solutions when you need them most. Custom Lighting Create the perfect atmosphere in your home with our custom lighting solutions. Our team works closely with you to design and install lighting that complements your style and enhances the functionality of your space. Whether you need task lighting, accent lighting, or energy-efficient solutions, we provide expert guidance every step of the way. Lighting Controls Take control of your home’s lighting with our advanced lighting control systems. From dimmers to smart home integrations, we offer a variety of options that provide seamless control over your lighting environment. Our systems are designed to enhance convenience, energy efficiency, and comfort, putting the power of light at your fingertips. Ready for Reliable and Quality Electrical Services?"
   }
